#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {name}"
msgstr "Instal·la {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {title}"
msgstr "Instal·la {title}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"A .deb file can't go on the system. For everything to work, look for {title} as an .rpm file or in Bazaar, the app store.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a box anyway, without those parts."
msgstr ""
"Instal·la {title}\n"
"\n"
"En una caixa, aquestes parts de {title} no funcionaran:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"Un fitxer .deb no es pot posar al sistema. Perquè tot funcioni, cerqueu {title} com a fitxer .rpm o al Bazaar, la botiga d'aplicacions.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: el posa igualment en una caixa, sense aquestes parts."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"It comes from {maker}'s own download source, which is added to the system so {title} keeps updating. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"To connect, you need a {maker} account."
msgstr ""
"Instal·la {title}\n"
"\n"
"Prové de la font de baixada pròpia de {maker}, que s'afegeix al sistema perquè {title} es continuï actualitzant. Cal la vostra contrasenya i un reinici.\n"
"\n"
"Per connectar-vos, necessiteu un compte de {maker}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Add to the system. In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"On the system, everything works. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or {setup}: puts it in a separate box. It's easier to remove, but those parts won't work."
msgstr ""
"Instal·la {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recomanat: «Afegeix al sistema». En una caixa, aquestes parts de {title} no funcionaran:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"Al sistema, tot funciona. Cal la vostra contrasenya i un reinici.\n"
"\n"
"O bé {setup}: el posa en una caixa a part. És més fàcil d'eliminar, però aquestes parts no funcionaran."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a separate box. Your system isn't changed, and Remove Apps takes it out cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Instal·la {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: el posa en una caixa a part. El sistema no es modifica, i «Elimina aplicacions» el treu net."

